  LocationName: Red Rocket Gas Station
  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: The store itself holds nothing of value, only rusted cans and empty
    bottles. The small employee section doesn't have anything that would be useful
    to you either. There is the small freezer section of the station that might hold
    something, but the door is blocked from the inside.
